DESCRIPTION:Leo Orlov\n\nLeo Orlov is a Toronto-based guitarist\, drummer
 \, and vocalist. With over a decade of teaching and performance experienc
 e\, he draws from diverse training in Spain\, Iran\, Brazil\, and Canada.
