SUMMARY: Distillery Summer Music Series: Natasha Meister
DESCRIPTION:Natasha Meister\n\nNatasha Meister is a singer-songwriter and
  guitarist from London\, Ontario. She began music at age 6\, performing i
 n church and local competitions before pursuing it full-time. With over a
  decade of international experience\, Natasha captivates audiences with h
 er powerful vocals and skilled guitar work. Her versatile style spans blu
 es\, jazz\, rock\, and pop. Notable highlights include opening for The Pi
 xies and LIVE on tour in South Africa in 2017.
