SUMMARY: Distillery Summer Music Series: romp. by Glenn Paul
DESCRIPTION:romp. by Glenn Paul\n\nJazz drummer. Bandleader. Curator.\n\n
 After years splitting time between main stages supporting artists and bac
 kground gigs playing pop and jazz\, Glenn created romp. — where those mus
 ical worlds meet. Inspired by musak\, or musical wallpaper\, romp. re-ima
 gines what background music can be. Familiar melodies\, re-interpreted by
  Glenn’s favorite local jazz musicians — players he’s lucky to call frien
 ds. It’s the soundtrack you know\, re-arranged for people who actually li
 sten.
