SUMMARY: Distillery Summer Music Series: Kajé & Desare
DESCRIPTION:Kajé & Desare\n\nJoin Toronto’s own Kajé for an unforgettable
  night of soul and R&B. With her mystic presence and timeless\, raspy voi
 ce\, Kajé blends the richness of jazz\, gospel\, and classic soul with a 
 modern edge. Fresh off performances at NXNE\, Sofar Sounds\, and Waveland
 \, she brings raw emotion and powerful storytelling to the stage. This is
  a performance that inspires unity\, pride\, and deep connection.
