DESCRIPTION:The Piano Pair\n\nThe Piano Pair of Terence Vince and Donavon
  LeNabat are excited to bring Dueling Pianos to the Trinity Stage! Terenc
 e and Donavon deliver a genre-spanning setlist packed with Pop\, Rock\, a
 nd Singalong hits from across the years. From blistering keys and powerho
 use vocals to clever mash-ups and sharp banter\, they command the stage\,
  inviting the audience to sing and dance to all their favourite tunes. Th
 ey might even take a request or two.\n\n
