SUMMARY: Distillery Summer Music Series: JJ & BART
DESCRIPTION:J.J Thompson\n\nJJ Thompson\, frontman of Canadian folk-rock 
 band JJ and The Pillars\, has built a dynamic career through both origina
 l music and unique covers. His songs “Way Home"\,"The Wolves:\, and “Burn
 ing Leaves” have earned millions of streams\, global radio play\, and a r
 ecurring feature on the hit series The Way Home. He’s shared stages with 
 acts like Arkells\, Blue Rodeo\, Big Wreck\, Finger Eleven\, and Billy Ta
 lent\, and now focuses on storytelling and celebrating Canadian music.
