SUMMARY: Distillery Country Music Series: Jade Hilton
DESCRIPTION:Fast-rising country singer-songwriter Jade Hilton is making w
 aves with her new single “I Want a Cowboy”. Written by Hilton at her pare
 nts’ farm in Norfolk County\, Ontario\, Hilton later brought the track so
 uth to Alabama\, where it was recorded live off the floor. “I Want a Cowb
 oy” blends Hilton’s classic country influences with a modern edge and off
 ers an early glimpse into the music she is preparing for her upcoming alb
 um. Last year\, Hilton’s breakout single “Dive Bar” earned her national a
 ttention including CTV’s Etalk\, who called Hilton “the hottest new talen
 t in country music”. Since then\, Hilton has delivered standout performan
 ces at Country Music Week and Folk Music Week. She was also named a final
 ist for the 2025 Boots and Hearts Emerging Artist Showcase. Just last mon
 th\, she headlined The Rivoli in Toronto for the first time and sold out 
 the venue.
