DESCRIPTION:Jordo Arnott\, aka “Jukebox Jordo\,” is a seasoned Toronto mu
 sician known for his genre-spanning repertoire and request-driven perform
 ances. From original projects and wedding bands\, his experience translat
 es into an energetic\, crowd-focused set. Guests can expect everything fr
 om country pop stars like Chris Stapleton\, Tyler Childers and more\, wit
 h Jordo putting his own spin on every song through his distinct style and
  on-stage charisma.
