SUMMARY: Distillery Country Music Series: Courtney Bowles
DESCRIPTION:Born and raised in Scarborough\, Ontario\, Courtney is a Cana
 dian singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist bringing heartfelt story
 telling\, powerhouse vocals\, and feel-good energy to every stage she ste
 ps on. Blending the spirit of modern country with pop sensibility\, Court
 ney’s performances are rooted in connection\, authenticity\, and the kind
  of songs that bring people together. Whether performing stripped-back ac
 oustic favourites or upbeat country-pop anthems\, she creates moments tha
 t feel both personal and unforgettable.
