SUMMARY: Distillery Country Music Series: Martina Dawn
DESCRIPTION:Martina Dawn is where country meets chaos and the fun never s
 tops. Hailing from Devon\, AB\, she brings small-town stories to the spot
 light through authentic\, real-life lyrics paired with a confident\, anyt
 hing-goes attitude. With over 17K followers\, 500K+ likes\, 350K streams\
 , and a CMAB Award to her name\, Martina is quickly establishing herself 
 as a standout artist and an engaging presence on social media. Like the d
 awn itself\, she brings bold energy and lights up every stage she steps o
 n.
