SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Jessica Sole
DESCRIPTION:With small town roots and a single lane highway leading home 
 to Shelburne\, Ontario\, emerging artist Jessica Sole’s dreams have soare
 d far beyond her hometown’s limits. Taking the stage from an early age\, 
 Jessica has been delicately crafting her skills as a songwriter and perfo
 rmer for over a decade. Hardworking by nature\, and a fresh perspective o
 n songwriting\, Jessica has queued up some big releases for 2026. Two thi
 ngs are for certain - Jessica Sole’s star will continue to rise\, and she
  will leave no rhinestone unturned.
