SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Jordo Arnott & Benji Crane
DESCRIPTION:Jordo Arnott\, also known as “Jukebox Jordo\,” and Benji Cran
 e bring together country-pop favourites\, acoustic hits\, and dynamic mus
 icianship for an engaging live experience. With Jordo’s soulful vocals\, 
 request-driven style\, and country influences from artists like Chris Sta
 pleton and Tyler Childers\, paired with Benji’s warm vocals and fiddle\, 
 the duo creates a sound that is both familiar and unique. From laid-back 
 atmosphere to upbeat crowd moments\, they deliver a versatile performance
  full of personality\, connection\, and energy.
