 ur-time Country Music Association of Ontario nominee\, she has brought he
 r high energy show to festivals like Boots and Hearts (opening for Stephe
 n Wilson Jr. and Hardy) and Meadows Music Festival (opening for Dean Brod
 y and Tim Hicks). Her music has been featured on Billboard Charts\, Siriu
 s XM\, editorial playlists and radio stations across the world.
