SUMMARY: Distillery Country Music Series: Paige Rutledge
DESCRIPTION:Paige Rutledge sparkles on stage - both figuratively\, and li
 terally. Her vibrant personality and rhinestone-studded guitar elevate he
 r already commanding presence.\n2023 proved to be Paige’s debut onto the 
 Canadian Country music scene with her heartfelt single\, “Gone Ain’t Real
 ly Gone”\, followed by the pleading ballad “The Worst Thing”. “The Worst 
 Thing” earned Paige a slot in regular rotation on SiriusXM Radio’s Top Of
  The Country. Paige has finished recording her debut full length album wh
 ich will be released in October.
