SUMMARY: Distillery Country Music Series: Bree Taylor
DESCRIPTION:Bree Taylor is an Ontario-based country rock artist known for
  her powerhouse vocals\, fearless songwriting\, and electrifying live per
 formances. Blending the grit of rock with the heart of country music\, sh
 e has built a reputation for delivering emotionally charged songs centere
 d on resilience\, self-worth\, and empowerment. A CMAOntario Songwriter o
 f the Year nominee for her breakup anthem “I Regret You\,” Taylor continu
 es to make her mark as both a compelling songwriter and dynamic live perf
 ormer. Throughout her career\, Taylor has shared the stage with notable a
 rtists including Sawyer Brown\, Josh Ross\, High Valley\, and the US coun
 try rock band Lakeview\, and has performed at major events such as CMA Fe
 st in Nashville\, TN. With a commanding stage presence\, powerful vocals\
 , and a high-energy live show that seamlessly blends country storytelling
  and rock ’n’ roll attitude\, Bree Taylor continues to establish herself 
 as a force in Canadian country music.
